  "uid": "zcrypto-main",
  "title": "zcrypto \u2014 Gate + NAS",
  "description": "The one canonical zcrypto dashboard (spec 00049, Role B / Task 4). Rows are namespaced (Gate \u00b7 ..., NAS \u00b7 ...) so a later VPS telemetry increment (T0020) can add its own namespaced rows to this same file without collision.",
